## Key Findings

1. Only 32.7% of tickets were resolved.
2. 67.3% of tickets remained unresolved.
3. Pending Customer Response represented the largest ticket status category.
4. Refund Requests generated the highest support demand.
5. Customer satisfaction averaged 2.99 out of 5.
6. More than 5,700 tickets lacked customer feedback.
7. Chat support delivered the strongest satisfaction performance.

---

## Business Recommendations

- Launch a backlog reduction initiative.
- Investigate refund request processes.
- Expand successful chat support practices.
- Improve customer follow-up processes.
- Standardize feedback collection.
- Strengthen SLA monitoring and reporting.

